## Minimal Seed Proposal

After completing discovery across both upstream repos, the skill surfaces this
summary dialog:

```
Discovery summary:
  - gateway-api:       HTTP gateway (no own DB)
  - auth-service:      Postgres (Liquibase); owns users + organizations + passwords
  - inventory-service: Postgres (Liquibase); owns applications

To make this scannable, you need:
  - 1 user (test-owner@example.com / ExampleSeedPass1!)  ← password seeded into auth table
  - 1 org  (Example Test Org)
  - 1 app  (target-app-1)

I'll seed:
  - user + org + membership in auth-service via SQL
  - app in inventory-service via SQL
  - env link via gateway-api REST API

OK to proceed, or expand? (e.g. need a READ_ONLY user, multiple apps, etc.)
```

The user confirms. The skill proceeds to emit all artifacts.

